{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>元朗公路發生交通意外。（fb「車cam L（香港群組）」圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>元朗公路發生交通意外。 今日（21 日）早上9時20分，一輛泥頭車於元朗公路、往元朗方向近福亨村位置與一輛5.5噸貨車相撞，貨車擋風玻璃破裂，貨車司機一度被困。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，將司機救出，再由救護車清醒送往醫院治理。警方正在調查車禍起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T06:20:47.536668+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:13:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:17:53.785415+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:17:47.678777+00:00","content_hash":"9720f5aa3c18bfa7d24425389a20f4c212a78c037107144ab2634363c35312e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}